{
  "declaredLength": 8440,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Escucha, joven... ¿Me podrías hacer un favorcillo?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007300630075006300680061002C0020006A006F00760065006E002E002E002E002000BF004D006500200070006F0064007200ED0061007300200068006100630065007200200075006E0020006600610076006F007200630069006C006C006F003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me gustaría que entregaras de mi parte una\ncarta a la directora de la Escuela Perseida.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo haría yo mismo, pero mis circunstancias me lo\nimpiden.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F002000680061007200ED006100200079006F0020006D00690073006D006F002C0020007000650072006F0020006D00690073002000630069007200630075006E007300740061006E00630069006100730020006D00650020006C006F000A0069006D0070006900640065006E002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué me dices? ¿Le llevarás la carta?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E90020006D0065002000640069006300650073003F002000BF004C00650020006C006C006500760061007200E100730020006C0061002000630061007200740061003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De acuerdo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650020006100630075006500720064006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Por qué tanto misterio?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0050006F007200200071007500E9002000740061006E0074006F0020006D006900730074006500720069006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tanto quieres saberlo, acepta mi encargo y\nenseguida descubrirás de qué se trata.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias! Ya sabía yo que un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa chic<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa tan maj<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa\ncomo tú aceptaría.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toma, esta es la carta en cuestión.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F006D0061002C002000650073007400610020006500730020006C006100200063006100720074006100200065006E002000630075006500730074006900F3006E002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Asegúrate de entregársela en mano a la directora\nde la <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Escuela Perseida<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo a ti te conozco...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSí, eres aquel<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȀla chic<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa que me ayudó a encontrar\nmi anillo. Te lo agradezco de corazón, joven.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y bien, ¿qué te trae hoy a la Escuela Perseida?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020006200690065006E002C002000BF0071007500E90020007400650020007400720061006500200068006F0079002000610020006C0061002000450073006300750065006C0061002000500065007200730065006900640061003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy buscando a la directora",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006F0079002000620075007300630061006E0064006F002000610020006C00610020006400690072006500630074006F007200610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tengo una carta para la directora",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006E0067006F00200075006E0061002000630061007200740061002000700061007200610020006C00610020006400690072006500630074006F007200610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pues estás de suerte, porque soy la directora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007500650073002000650073007400E100730020006400650020007300750065007200740065002C00200070006F007200710075006500200073006F00790020006C00610020006400690072006500630074006F00720061002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le has entregado la Carta Importante a Remi.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065002000680061007300200065006E007400720065006700610064006F0020006C006100200043006100720074006100200049006D0070006F007200740061006E0074006500200061002000520065006D0069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿D-de dónde has sacado esta carta?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0044002D006400650020006400F3006E006400650020006800610073002000730061006300610064006F00200065007300740061002000630061007200740061003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, espera. Antes de nada, debo comprobar\nuna cosa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006500730070006500720061002E00200041006E0074006500730020006400650020006E006100640061002C0020006400650062006F00200063006F006D00700072006F006200610072000A0075006E006100200063006F00730061002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Podrías pasarte por <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Construcciones Radix<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>,\npor favor? Está en el sector 6 del Distrito Verde.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por haber venido.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006300690061007300200070006F0072002000680061006200650072002000760065006E00690064006F002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por venir hasta aquí, maj<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006300690061007300200070006F0072002000760065006E00690072002000680061007300740061002000610071007500ED002C0020006D0061006A00100003110000FF0101006F0061002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tal vez debería haber venido a comprobarlo sola,\npero esta carta es tan extraña...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBueno, mejor te la leo y así acabamos antes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "\"Querida mía, siento haberme ido de tu vida sin\npoder decirte esto en persona\".<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n\"Hace 14 años, confié mi anillo a un hombre para\nque lo reparara\".<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n\"Se llama Estragón y es el propietario de\nConstrucciones Radix\".<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 222
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es imposible que me haya escrito mi difunto\nmarido... Por eso me ha dado miedo venir sola.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Es usted Estragón?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450073002000750073007400650064002000450073007400720061006700F3006E003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El mismo. ¿En qué puedo ayudarla?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020006D00690073006D006F002E002000BF0045006E00200071007500E900200070007500650064006F0020006100790075006400610072006C0061003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdone, pero...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Recuerda que un hombre viniera hace 14 años\npara confiarle la reparación de un anillo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Como si fuera ayer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006F00200073006900200066007500650072006100200061007900650072002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aquel día fuimos a un restaurante a celebrar\nel cumpleaños de mi Naria.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me puse a hablar con el hombre de la mesa de\nal lado. ¡Hasta a Naria le cayó bien!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando le conté cómo me gano la vida,\nme pidió que lo ayudara con una piedra<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nque se le había soltado de un anillo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me dijo que el anillo iba a juego con el de su\nmujer y que era muy importante para él.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aquel hombre era mi marido, pero poco después\ntuvo un accidente y...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007100750065006C00200068006F006D00620072006500200065007200610020006D00690020006D0061007200690064006F002C0020007000650072006F00200070006F0063006F00200064006500730070007500E90073000A007400750076006F00200075006E0020006100630063006900640065006E0074006500200079002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, lo siento mucho.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002C0020006C006F0020007300690065006E0074006F0020006D007500630068006F002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y qué la trae por aquí tantos años después,\nsi puedo preguntar?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005900200071007500E90020006C00610020007400720061006500200070006F0072002000610071007500ED002000740061006E0074006F00730020006100F1006F007300200064006500730070007500E90073002C000A0073006900200070007500650064006F002000700072006500670075006E007400610072003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es mi deber pagarle por la reparación del anillo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730020006D0069002000640065006200650072002000700061006700610072006C006500200070006F00720020006C006100200072006500700061007200610063006900F3006E002000640065006C00200061006E0069006C006C006F002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, señora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00720020006600610076006F0072002C00200073006500F1006F00720061002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No puedo aceptar su dinero, pero a lo mejor...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nComo pago de la deuda, sí aceptaría un combate\ncontra <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te espero en el garaje, chaval<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa! Ven cuando\nestés list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540065002000650073007000650072006F00200065006E00200065006C00200067006100720061006A0065002C002000630068006100760061006C00100003110000FF010000610021002000560065006E0020006300750061006E0064006F000A00650073007400E900730020006C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, siento tener que pedirte este\nfavor también.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C0020007300690065006E0074006F002000740065006E0065007200200071007500650020007000650064006900720074006500200065007300740065000A006600610076006F0072002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Además de las clases de repostería, Grisel me\nestá ayudando a mejorar mi técnica de combate.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Quiero enseñarte lo que he aprendido!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Voy a ganar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10056006F007900200061002000670061006E0061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si no aceptas el combate, no podré devolverle\nel anillo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006E006F0020006100630065007000740061007300200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065002C0020006E006F00200070006F0064007200E90020006400650076006F006C007600650072006C0065000A0065006C00200061006E0069006C006C006F002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y ahora, ¡manos a la obra!\n¡Que comience el combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002000610068006F00720061002C002000A1006D0061006E006F0073002000610020006C00610020006F0062007200610021000A00A100510075006500200063006F006D00690065006E0063006500200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ex-ca-drill! ¡Ex-ca-drill! ¡Demuestra por qué\nte llaman el Rey del Taladro!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así se hace, chaval<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa! Aunque Excadrill y yo no te\nlo hemos puesto fácil, ¿a que no?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDespués de todo lo que has hecho por nosotros,\nqué menos que esforzarnos para mejorar y poder<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndarte un combate en condiciones.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 227
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora que ya has saldado la deuda, aquí tienes\nel anillo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 7212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F0072006100200071007500650020007900610020006800610073002000730061006C006400610064006F0020006C0061002000640065007500640061002C002000610071007500ED0020007400690065006E00650073000A0065006C00200061006E0069006C006C006F002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 7336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has entregado el Anillo Preciado.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 7360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007300200065006E007400720065006700610064006F00200065006C00200041006E0069006C006C006F00200050007200650063006900610064006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando perdí a mi marido, no fui capaz de\nencontrar su anillo...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPero al fin he conseguido recuperarlo. Guardaré\nambos junto con nuestros preciados recuerdos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 166
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No sé cómo darte las gracias, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLograste recuperar mi anillo y ahora también el\nde mi marido.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo también me quedo más tranquilo sabiendo\nque he devuelto el anillo a su legítima dueña.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 8160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He tenido un sueño maravilloso.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEra el día en que mi marido me dio el anillo y\nestábamos charlando sin preocupación alguna...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 8172,
